# Each kind of row keeps to a lane of the reading column (the reference's
# TranscriptLane, D122693862): messages at most 80% of it, flush to their side
# (the reader's avatar included), tool calls and thinking at most 75% from the
# leading edge -- so the two sides of the conversation always leave open
# column between them, and a run of work ends short of the replies.
#
# Resized to 1800 wide: pane 1520, Fit to pane column 1280 -> the content column is
# 1280 - 32 = 1248: a reply is floor(0.8 * 1248) = 998 wide (the reference's
# PixelProbe: 998pt), and a tool row floor(0.75 * 1248) = 936.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":900,"open_tabs":["rfold"],"active_tab":"rfold","theme":"dark"}
# env: HANABI_FOLD_DEMO=1
require_thread rfold
resize 1800 900
wait_frames 20
assert_ui asst_bubble w=998
assert_ui tool_pile w=936
